\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Included noise contributions after ordered, varying-arm TDI~2 and clock correction. The black curve is their quadrature sum. The board-jitter curve uses independent Rb-model timing fluctuations; it is not measured board performance. The calculation uses the changing delays and constant frequency plan of Section~\ref {sec:noise_propagation}. The dashed reference is the OMS-plus-acceleration model propagated as four independent equivalent link noises. Delay-implementation residuals are excluded, so the sum is not a sensitivity prediction for the assembled testbed.}}{14}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:total_tdi2_noise}{{5}{14}{Included noise contributions after ordered, varying-arm TDI~2 and clock correction. The black curve is their quadrature sum. The board-jitter curve uses independent Rb-model timing fluctuations; it is not measured board performance. The calculation uses the changing delays and constant frequency plan of Section~\ref {sec:noise_propagation}. The dashed reference is the OMS-plus-acceleration model propagated as four independent equivalent link noises. Delay-implementation residuals are excluded, so the sum is not a sensitivity prediction for the assembled testbed}{figure.5}{}}
